<html><head><!-- #BeginEditable "doctitle" --> <title>Untitled Document</title><!-- #EndEditable --> <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=iso-8859-1"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../Library/styles.xml"><style type="text/css"><!--.felixstyle {  font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: #000000}.headeron {  font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; color: 990000}--></style></head><body bgcolor="#FFFFFF"><span class="felixstyle"></span><!-- #BeginEditable "bodytable" --> <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="8" name="maintable" height="254">  <tr>     <td height="47" colspan="2"><img src="../pages/intro/images/twelvecopy.gif" width="449" height="25"></td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td colspan="2"><img src="../pages/snowmoon/images/snowmooncopy.gif" width="334" height="25"></td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td colspan="2" class="felixstyle">       <div align="center"></div>      When from the sky above the Great Mystery let fall the shining beams on       the Grey Earth, and the gusty winds howling and tossing the beams to and       fro and then cease their moments. And beholds the Earth now completely covered       by the beams shining white, appears a scattered pattern by the many design       created and left by the footprints of man, animal and bird, only to be melted       and dissolved into a dew seeping into the Earth and consumed by the gusts       of the Fair-Winds. The Red Man believed too that the animals in hibernation       danced in a visionary landscaped as symbolised by the bear.</td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td height="24" colspan="2" class="headeron">       <div align="left">Dance Steps</div>    </td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td class="felixstyle" rowspan="3" width="58%">       <div align="left"><img src="../pages/snowmoon/images/tinydances/snowrotate.gif" width="397" height="294" class="headeron"></div>    </td>    <td class="felixstyle" height="97" width="42%">       <p>See the individual dance steps: </p>      <p class="felixstyle">1 2 3 4</p>    </td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td class="felixstyle" height="119" width="42%">See the backdrop</td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td class="felixstyle" width="42%">       <p>Next Dance<br>        &gt;&gt;</p>    </td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td colspan="2" class="felixstyle" height="20">       <div align="center">&copy; Betty Junaluska 2000</div>    </td>  </tr></table><!-- #EndEditable --></body></html>